{"ea8a229e": "灯|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "d135f4d6": "街|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "d5296322": "道|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "b84c6ee8": "宽|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "a160c1b3": "交|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "1e29d60d": "通|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "5c459214": "忙|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "8545d29f": "往|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "1a46bd2e": "弟|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "bc494f34": "妹|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "4ca57fe4": "拉|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "d957a7db": "停|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "86a56332": "火字旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "029725a6": "双人旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "fee4e53b": "走之底|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "2fcd9c4a": "宝盖头|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "9ae0a80a": "点横头|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "4700430d": "竖心旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "de12b73a": "倒八|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "0278548a": "女字旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "22765bb7": "提手旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "0e3b57ed": "单人旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "84b4e752": "风筝往上飞。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "a77ec349": "到了路口，我们往右拐。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "059ba982": "下雨了，小猫往屋里跑。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "7eca9556": "到了第二个路口，再往左拐。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "7d64a030": "气球往上飘。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "5404c1d2": "公交车往北开。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "5884e89a": "弟弟拉着我往楼上跑。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "0c3c5f11": "绿灯亮了，我们往对面走。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "ee56457e": "红灯|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "02dad7e3": "路灯|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "dc0d3d5f": "街道|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "c11deb3e": "上街|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "22cc5049": "知道|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "5e02ecb7": "道路|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "ee6fa53e": "很宽|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "eefbdadd": "宽大|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "b3a08d0b": "交通|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "9804fbd9": "交朋友|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "190b5db1": "普通|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "6389e038": "通知|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "4aabadf8": "帮忙|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "db20267b": "急忙|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "9e69ca96": "往前|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "fa0b7920": "来往|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "8e961323": "弟弟|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "65e422e4": "兄弟|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "f40e7ff7": "妹妹|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "f7d93a82": "姐妹|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "56edba7d": "拉手|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "8bf2c6ec": "拉开|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "e1352187": "停车|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "f5651270": "停下|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "46e067bf": "星期六，爸爸带我、弟弟和妹妹去图书馆。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "114b6c39": "我拉着妹妹的手，弟弟拉着我的手。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "31d5343b": "我家门口的街道又宽又长，两边有很多小店。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "82ffdd03": "周末路上的车很多，交通有点儿堵。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "6ce07047": "走到路口，我们看见了红灯，就站在那里等。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "4c7e043e": "妹妹想往前跑，爸爸说：\"红灯要停下！\"|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "fe65cd54": "绿灯亮了，我们手拉着手往前走。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "080c1cc1": "爸爸说：\"我们都知道，过马路要走人行横道。\"|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "63c6ff81": "这条街上来往的人很多，大家都出来玩。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "c5bf2646": "路边有一排路灯，晚上会亮起来。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "770139ea": "图书馆的大门很宽，很多人一起进去也不挤。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "1e6ff908": "我找不到恐龙书，图书馆的阿姨过来帮忙。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "ea30ae57": "回到家，我拉开窗帘，看见外面的路灯都亮了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "d6e05080": "今天我们走路去图书馆。弟弟、妹妹，出门要手拉手，别松开！|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "91d23150": "这条街道好宽啊！路上的车真多，大家都好忙。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "514bab7f": "前面的路口有交通灯，现在是红灯！|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "a49db674": "那我们就停下来，等一等。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "6e5587c7": "灯变绿了！我们可以过去了吗？|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "ebd55aad": "先往左看，再往右看。没有车了，我们往前走。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "24dea857": "我拉着妹妹，弟弟拉着我，我们一起走过斑马线！|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "726d1fed": "真棒！过马路的时候，眼睛要看路，不跑也不闹。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "bafd1700": "台灯|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "bea63450": "开灯|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "8a8e0943": "大街|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "151c1ad7": "逛街|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "92aba403": "味道|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "d8699057": "小道|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "d5b66f82": "宽敞|zh-